	"CITY_BRUTALIST": {"es": "Brutalista", "en": "Brutalist"},
	"BEST_GOLEM_NAME": {"es": "Gólem de papel higiénico", "en": "Toilet-Paper Golem"},
	"BEST_GOLEM_DESC": {"es": "Lento, enorme y blandito: aguanta mucho, pero se rompe fácil. Si me toca, huelo tan mal que se me cae una de las armas un rato.", "en": "Slow, huge and squishy: it takes a lot, but tears easily. If it touches me I smell so bad that I drop one of my weapons for a while."},
	"KW_BLEED_NAME": {"es": "Sangrado", "en": "Bleeding"},
	"KW_BLEED_DESC": {"es": "Pierde vida poco a poco durante unos segundos y su defensa baja al 75 %.", "en": "Loses health bit by bit for a few seconds, and its defence drops to 75%."},
	"KW_BURN_NAME": {"es": "Quemadura", "en": "Burn"},
	"KW_BURN_DESC": {"es": "Daño flojo durante unos segundos, pero mientras arde hace menos daño y recibe más.", "en": "Weak damage for a few seconds, but while it burns it deals less damage and takes more."},
	"KW_SLOW_NAME": {"es": "Lento", "en": "Slowed"},
	"KW_SLOW_DESC": {"es": "Va más despacio durante unos segundos. A los enemigos, además, les cuesta más atacar.", "en": "Moves more slowly for a few seconds. Enemies also take longer to attack."},
	"KW_FREEZE_NAME": {"es": "Congelado", "en": "Frozen"},
	"KW_FREEZE_DESC": {"es": "Se queda quieto sin poder moverse ni atacar durante unos segundos.", "en": "Stands still, unable to move or attack, for a few seconds."},
	"KW_GLITCH_NAME": {"es": "Glitch", "en": "Glitch"},
	"KW_GLITCH_DESC": {"es": "Un error en el sueño que provoca Silly: según la mejora, el enemigo se congela, va a cámara lenta o recibe más daño un rato.", "en": "A fault in the dream caused by Silly: depending on the upgrade, the enemy freezes, goes into slow motion or takes extra damage for a while."},
	"KW_FLUFF_NAME": {"es": "Pelusa", "en": "Fluff"},
	"KW_FLUFF_DESC": {"es": "Cada pelusa pegada frena al enemigo (hasta un 60 %) y se cae a los 8 s.", "en": "Each stuck fluff slows the enemy (up to 60%) and falls off after 8 s."},
	"KW_STUCK_NAME": {"es": "Pegados", "en": "Stuck"},
	"KW_STUCK_DESC": {"es": "Dos enemigos con pelusa que se tocan se quedan pegados y van aún más lentos. Si se juntan 5, se aplastan entre ellos.", "en": "Two fluffy enemies that touch get stuck together and go even slower. If 5 clump up, they crush each other."},
	"KW_KNOCKBACK_NAME": {"es": "Empuje", "en": "Knockback"},
	"KW_KNOCKBACK_DESC": {"es": "Aparta al enemigo. Si lo empujas contra un agujero del suelo o de la pared, se cae y muere aunque le quede vida (los jefes no).", "en": "Pushes the enemy away. Shove it into a hole in the floor or the wall and it falls and dies even with health left (bosses don't)."},
	"KW_HEAVY_NAME": {"es": "Golpe fuerte", "en": "Heavy hit"},
	"KW_HEAVY_DESC": {"es": "Cada pocos golpes, uno empuja muchísimo: sirve para tirar enemigos por los agujeros. Los puntitos bajo los pies de Kroker cuentan cuánto falta (dorados: el siguiente es fuerte). Tirar a varios seguidos hace una caída en cadena que da trozos de estrella extra.", "en": "Every few hits, one shoves really hard: use it to throw enemies down holes. The dots under Kroker's feet count how close it is (gold: the next one is heavy). Throwing several in a row makes a fall chain that gives extra star shards."},
	"CHIPV_HEAVY": {"es": "Golpe fuerte cada {n}", "en": "Heavy hit every {n}"},
	"HEAVY_HIT": {"es": "¡PAM!", "en": "WHAM!"},
	"FALL_CHAIN": {"es": "¡Caída en cadena x%d!", "en": "Fall chain x%d!"},
	"KW_STENCH_NAME": {"es": "Mal olor", "en": "Stench"},
	"KW_STENCH_DESC": {"es": "Una de tus dos armas, al azar, deja de funcionar durante unos segundos.", "en": "One of your two weapons, at random, stops working for a few seconds."},
	"KW_HACK_NAME": {"es": "Hackeo", "en": "Hack"},
	"KW_HACK_DESC": {"es": "Te baja una estadística al azar hasta que derrotas a quien te ha hackeado.", "en": "Lowers a random stat until you beat whoever hacked you."},
	"KW_CRIT_NAME": {"es": "Crítico", "en": "Critical"},
	"KW_CRIT_DESC": {"es": "Golpe que hace más daño de lo normal (x1,75).", "en": "A hit that deals more damage than usual (x1.75)."},
	"KW_DEFENSE_NAME": {"es": "Defensa", "en": "Defense"},
	"KW_DEFENSE_DESC": {"es": "Resta daño a cada golpe que recibes, pero nunca más de la mitad del golpe. Por encima de 6, cada punto rinde la mitad.", "en": "Takes damage off every hit you receive, but never more than half the hit. Above 6, each point is worth half."},
	"KW_LUCK_NAME": {"es": "Suerte", "en": "Luck"},
	"KW_LUCK_DESC": {"es": "Mejoras de nivel más raras, más objetos de los enemigos y más probabilidad de que vuelvan los personajes que ya te ayudaron.", "en": "Rarer level-up upgrades, more items from enemies and a better chance that characters who already helped you come back."},
	"KW_ATTACK_SPEED_NAME": {"es": "Velocidad de ataque", "en": "Attack speed"},
	"KW_ATTACK_SPEED_DESC": {"es": "Tus armas atacan más a menudo.", "en": "Your weapons attack more often."},
	"KW_REGEN_NAME": {"es": "Regeneración", "en": "Regeneration"},
	"KW_REGEN_DESC": {"es": "Recuperas esa cantidad de vida cada 5 segundos. Por encima de 1,5 rinde menos, y junto al robo de salud no cura más de 0,5 por segundo.", "en": "You recover that much health every 5 seconds. Above 1.5 it's worth less, and together with life steal it can't heal more than 0.5 per second."},
	"KW_LIFESTEAL_NAME": {"es": "Robo de salud", "en": "Lifesteal"},
	"KW_LIFESTEAL_DESC": {"es": "Probabilidad de curarte 1 de vida cada vez que golpeas (como mucho, una vez por segundo). Por encima de 8 rinde la mitad, y junto a la regeneración no cura más de 0,5 por segundo.", "en": "Chance to heal 1 health every time you hit (at most once per second). Above 8 it's worth half, and together with regeneration it can't heal more than 0.5 per second."},
	"KW_REALITY_NAME": {"es": "Realidad Fragmentada", "en": "Fragmented Reality"},
	"KW_REALITY_DESC": {"es": "La moneda de los sueños: sirve para comprarle a Charo y para dar propinas. Solo dura una partida.", "en": "The currency of dreams: spend it at Charo's and on tips. It only lasts one run."},
	"KW_ROOTED_NAME": {"es": "Inmovilizado", "en": "Rooted"},
	"KW_ROOTED_DESC": {"es": "Te quedas clavado en el sitio un momento (por un sartenazo o una descarga): no puedes moverte, pero tus armas siguen atacando.", "en": "You're stuck to the spot for a moment (from a pan whack or a zap): you can't move, but your weapons keep attacking."},
	"KW_MANY_TITLE": {"es": "En esta carta", "en": "On this card"},
	"CTRL_KB_MOVE": {"es": "WASD o flechas", "en": "WASD or arrows"},
	"CTRL_KB_PAUSE": {"es": "Esc", "en": "Esc"},
	"CTRL_KB_SPECIAL": {"es": "E", "en": "E"},
	"CTRL_KB_ACCEPT": {"es": "Enter o clic", "en": "Enter or click"},
	"CTRL_KB_BACK": {"es": "Esc", "en": "Esc"},
	"CTRL_KB_INTERACT": {"es": "F", "en": "F"},
	"CTRL_PAD_MOVE": {"es": "Stick o cruceta", "en": "Stick or D-pad"},
	"CTRL_PAD_PAUSE": {"es": "Start", "en": "Start"},
	"CTRL_PAD_SPECIAL": {"es": "Y", "en": "Y"},
	"CTRL_PAD_ACCEPT": {"es": "A", "en": "A"},
	"CTRL_PAD_BACK": {"es": "B", "en": "B"},
	"CTRL_PAD_PS_PAUSE": {"es": "Options", "en": "Options"},
	"CTRL_PAD_PS_SPECIAL": {"es": "Triángulo", "en": "Triangle"},
	"CTRL_PAD_PS_ACCEPT": {"es": "Cruz", "en": "Cross"},
	"CTRL_PAD_PS_BACK": {"es": "Círculo", "en": "Circle"},
	"CTRL_PAD_NIN_PAUSE": {"es": "+", "en": "+"},
	"CTRL_PAD_NIN_SPECIAL": {"es": "X", "en": "X"},
	"CTRL_PAD_NIN_ACCEPT": {"es": "B", "en": "B"},
	"CTRL_PAD_NIN_BACK": {"es": "A", "en": "A"},
	"PARRY_SNAP": {"es": "¡Chas!", "en": "Snap!"},
	"KW_PARRY_NAME": {"es": "Parry", "en": "Parry"},
	"KW_PARRY_DESC": {"es": "Probabilidad de esquivar un golpe. Al hacerlo, chasqueas los dedos y caen quien te atacaba y hasta 3 enemigos cercanos (a los jefes solo les hace daño). Nunca pasa del 20 % (30 % con el pijama de la almohada).", "en": "Chance to dodge a hit. When you do, you snap your fingers and whoever attacked you plus up to 3 nearby enemies drop (bosses only take damage). It never goes above 20% (30% with the pillow pajamas)."},
	# La pelota / The ball
	"SELECT_UNLOCK_BALL": {"es": "Llega a amistad 4 con Svinho para desbloquear este pijama.", "en": "Reach friendship 4 with Svinho to unlock these pajamas."},
	"CHAR_BALL_NAME": {"es": "El Crack", "en": "The Star Player"},
	"CHAR_BALL_TAG": {"es": "Regateador", "en": "Dribbler"},
	"CHAR_BALL_WEAPON": {"es": "Pelota", "en": "Ball"},
	"CHAR_BALL_BONUS": {"es": "+15 % de ataque y más velocidad, +6 de parry", "en": "+15% attack and more speed, +6 parry"},
	"CHAR_BALL_OUTFIT": {"es": "Pijama de equipación", "en": "Football-kit pajamas"},
	"CHAR_BALL_DESC": {"es": "Chuta la pelota al enemigo más cercano; rebota de uno a otro y vuelve. Empieza con la mejora de Svinho a nivel 3.", "en": "Kicks the ball at the nearest enemy; it bounces from one to the next and comes back. Starts with Svinho's upgrade at level 3."},
	"WEAPON_SHORT_BALL": {"es": "Pelota", "en": "Ball"},
	"UP_SVINHO_BALL_NAME": {"es": "Tiki-taka", "en": "Tiki-taka"},
	"UP_SVINHO_BALL_DESC": {"es": "La pelota rebota en {extra} enemigo(s) más antes de volver.", "en": "The ball bounces off {extra} more enemy(ies) before coming back."},
	"UP_STOLK_BALL_NAME": {"es": "Balonazo", "en": "Ball to the face"},
	"UP_STOLK_BALL_DESC": {"es": "+{pct} % de daño con la pelota.", "en": "+{pct}% ball damage."},
	"UP_SILLY_BALL_NAME": {"es": "Balón glitch", "en": "Glitch ball"},
	"UP_SILLY_BALL_DESC": {"es": "Cada rebote tiene un {chance} % de congelar al enemigo {secs} s.", "en": "Each bounce has a {chance}% chance to freeze the enemy for {secs} s."},
	"UP_DOC_BALL_NAME": {"es": "Rodillera", "en": "Knee pad"},
	"UP_DOC_BALL_DESC": {"es": "+{hp} de vida máxima, pero tarda un {pct} % más en volver a chutar.", "en": "+{hp} max health, but takes {pct}% longer to kick again."},
	"UP_AD_BALL_NAME": {"es": "Patrocinador", "en": "Sponsor"},
	"UP_AD_BALL_DESC": {"es": "{extra} % de ganar 1 más de Realidad Fragmentada. +{per10} de parry por cada 10 que tengas ahorradas.", "en": "{extra}% chance to gain 1 more Fragmented Reality. +{per10} parry for every 10 you have saved."},
	"UP_PINCHE_BALL_NAME": {"es": "Tacos de aluminio", "en": "Aluminium studs"},
	"UP_PINCHE_BALL_DESC": {"es": "Cada rebote hace sangrar: {dps} de daño por segundo durante {secs} s.", "en": "Every bounce causes bleeding: {dps} damage per second for {secs} s."},
	"ACH_BALL_NAME": {"es": "¡Golazo!", "en": "What a goal!"},
	"ACH_BALL_DESC": {"es": "Llega a amistad 4 con Svinho. Desbloquea el pijama de la pelota.", "en": "Reach friendship 4 with Svinho. Unlocks the ball pajamas."},
	# Kiosco: artículos nuevos y ventajas de la amistad / Kiosk: new wares and friendship perks
	"WARE_SNEAKERS_NAME": {"es": "Zapatillas con luces", "en": "Light-up trainers"},
	"WARE_SNEAKERS_DESC": {"es": "+6 % de velocidad. Y brillan al pisar.", "en": "+6% speed. And they flash when you step."},
	"WARE_PLASTERS_NAME": {"es": "Caja de tiritas", "en": "Box of plasters"},
	"WARE_PLASTERS_DESC": {"es": "+0,5 de regeneración.", "en": "+0.5 regeneration."},
	"WARE_SODA_NAME": {"es": "Refresco con gas", "en": "Fizzy pop"},
	"WARE_SODA_DESC": {"es": "+12 % de velocidad de ataque.", "en": "+12% attack speed."},
	"WARE_STICKERS_NAME": {"es": "Sobre de cromos", "en": "Sticker pack"},
	"WARE_STICKERS_DESC": {"es": "+2 de parry. Te salen todos repes.", "en": "+2 parry. All duplicates, of course."},
	"WARE_SANDWICH_NAME": {"es": "Bocata de la merienda", "en": "After-school sandwich"},
	"WARE_SANDWICH_DESC": {"es": "Recupera toda tu vida.", "en": "Restores all your health."},
	"WARE_GOLD_STICKER_NAME": {"es": "Cromo dorado", "en": "Golden sticker"},
	"WARE_GOLD_STICKER_DESC": {"es": "Una mejora épica de una estadística al azar.", "en": "An epic boost to a random stat."},
	"WARE_CAKE_NAME": {"es": "Tarta de cumpleaños", "en": "Birthday cake"},
	"WARE_CAKE_DESC": {"es": "Recupera toda tu vida y +5 de vida máxima.", "en": "Restores all your health and +5 max health."},
	"WARE_COIN_NAME": {"es": "Moneda de chocolate", "en": "Chocolate coin"},
	"WARE_ENERGY_DRINK_NAME": {"es": "Bebida energética", "en": "Energy drink"},
	"WARE_ENERGY_DRINK_DESC": {"es": "+20 % de velocidad de ataque y +8 % de velocidad.", "en": "+20% attack speed and +8% speed."},
	"WARE_LUCKY_CAT_NAME": {"es": "Gato de la suerte", "en": "Lucky cat"},
	"WARE_LUCKY_CAT_DESC": {"es": "+20 de suerte y +2 de parry.", "en": "+20 luck and +2 parry."},
	"WARE_FIRST_AID_NAME": {"es": "Botiquín", "en": "First-aid kit"},
	"WARE_FIRST_AID_DESC": {"es": "Recupera toda tu vida y +10 de vida máxima.", "en": "Restores all your health and +10 max health."},
	"WARE_COMIC_NAME": {"es": "Cómic de SuperK", "en": "SuperK comic"},
	"WARE_COMIC_DESC": {"es": "Una estadística legendaria al azar.", "en": "A random legendary stat."},
	"WARE_ENCYCLOPEDIA_NAME": {"es": "Enciclopedia", "en": "Encyclopedia"},
	"WARE_ENCYCLOPEDIA_DESC": {"es": "Dos mejoras al azar suben de nivel y además subes un nivel.", "en": "Two random upgrades level up, and you also gain a level."},
	"WARE_RUBBER_DUCK_NAME": {"es": "Patito de goma", "en": "Rubber duck"},
	"WARE_RUBBER_DUCK_DESC": {"es": "Al empezar cada sueño flota a tu lado y para el primer golpe que te den. Solo hace falta uno.", "en": "At the start of each dream it floats beside you and blocks the first hit you take. You only need one."},
	"WARE_FIRECRACKERS_NAME": {"es": "Petardos", "en": "Firecrackers"},
	"WARE_FIRECRACKERS_DESC": {"es": "Cuando te dan, estallan a tu alrededor: hacen 3 de daño y empujan lejos a los enemigos cercanos.", "en": "When you're hit they go off around you: 3 damage, and nearby enemies get pushed far away."},
	"WARE_PIGGY_BANK_NAME": {"es": "Hucha de cerdito", "en": "Piggy bank"},
	"WARE_PIGGY_BANK_DESC": {"es": "Al acabar cada sueño te da 1 de Realidad Fragmentada por cada 8 que tengas ahorrados (hasta 4). Con más huchas, por cada menos.", "en": "At the end of each dream it gives you 1 Fragmented Reality for every 8 you have saved (up to 4). More piggy banks need fewer saved."},
	"WARE_WATER_BALLOON_NAME": {"es": "Globos de agua", "en": "Water balloons"},
	"WARE_WATER_BALLOON_DESC": {"es": "Cada 5 s cae un globo sobre el enemigo más cercano: 4 de daño y ralentiza a los de alrededor.", "en": "Every 5 s a balloon drops on the nearest enemy: 4 damage, and it slows those around it."},
	"WARE_WHISTLE_NAME": {"es": "Silbato de árbitro", "en": "Referee's whistle"},
	"WARE_WHISTLE_DESC": {"es": "Cada enemigo que cae por un agujero te cura 2 de vida. ¡Fuera del campo!", "en": "Every enemy that falls down a hole heals you 2 health. Off the pitch!"},
	"WARE_VOODOO_NAME": {"es": "Muñeco vudú", "en": "Voodoo doll"},
	"WARE_VOODOO_DESC": {"es": "Quien te hace daño recibe el triple del daño que te ha hecho (los jefes, solo el mismo).", "en": "Whoever hurts you takes triple the damage they dealt (bosses just take the same)."},
	"WARE_MAGNET_NAME": {"es": "Imán de nevera", "en": "Fridge magnet"},
	"WARE_MAGNET_DESC": {"es": "Los trozos de estrella vienen hacia ti desde el doble de lejos.", "en": "Star shards come to you from twice as far away."},
	"WARE_MATCHES_NAME": {"es": "Caja de cerillas", "en": "Box of matches"},
	"WARE_MATCHES_DESC": {"es": "Los enemigos que derrotas tienen un 20 % de probabilidad de quemar a los de al lado (si no estaban ya ardiendo).", "en": "Enemies you defeat have a 20% chance to set their neighbours burning (unless they were already burning)."},
	"WARE_ALARM_CLOCK_NAME": {"es": "Despertador", "en": "Alarm clock"},
	"WARE_ALARM_CLOCK_DESC": {"es": "Cuando te queda poca vida, suena: los enemigos cercanos se quedan congelados 2,5 s. Una vez por sueño; solo hace falta uno.", "en": "When you're low on health it rings: nearby enemies are frozen for 2.5 s. Once per dream; you only need one."},
	"WARE_PINATA_NAME": {"es": "Piñata", "en": "Piñata"},
	"WARE_PINATA_DESC": {"es": "Los élites siempre sueltan un objeto y 2 de Realidad Fragmentada más.", "en": "Elites always drop an item and 2 extra Fragmented Reality."},
	"WARE_SNOW_GLOBE_NAME": {"es": "Bola de nieve", "en": "Snow globe"},
	"WARE_SNOW_GLOBE_DESC": {"es": "Cada vez que subes de nivel, congela 2 s a todos los enemigos de la pantalla.", "en": "Every time you level up, it freezes every enemy on screen for 2 s."},
	"WARE_MUSIC_BOX_NAME": {"es": "Caja de música", "en": "Music box"},
	"WARE_MUSIC_BOX_DESC": {"es": "Cada 14 s suena una nana: los enemigos cercanos se duermen 3 s y reciben un 50 % más de daño.", "en": "Every 14 s it plays a lullaby: nearby enemies fall asleep for 3 s and take 50% more damage."},
	"TRINKET_ALARM": {"es": "¡RIIING!", "en": "RIIING!"},
	"WARE_COIN_DESC": {"es": "+12 de suerte y +1 de parry.", "en": "+12 luck and +1 parry."},
	"WARE_BATTERIES_NAME": {"es": "Pack de pilas", "en": "Battery multipack"},
	"WARE_BATTERIES_DESC": {"es": "Subes dos niveles ahora mismo.", "en": "You level up twice right now."},
	"WARE_SUNDAY_PAPER_NAME": {"es": "El periódico del domingo", "en": "The Sunday paper"},
	"WARE_SUNDAY_PAPER_DESC": {"es": "Dos de tus mejoras suben un nivel.", "en": "Two of your upgrades go up a level."},
	"SHOP_OFFER": {"es": "¡Oferta!", "en": "On offer!"},
	"SHOP_BUY_OFFER": {"es": "Comprar · {cost} ◆ (antes {old})", "en": "Buy · {cost} ◆ (was {old})"},
	"SHOP_REROLL": {"es": "Cambiar el mostrador · {cost} ◆", "en": "Restock the counter · {cost} ◆"},
	"SHOP_REROLL_FREE": {"es": "Cambiar el mostrador · gratis ({n})", "en": "Restock the counter · free ({n})"},
	"SHOP_PERK_REROLLS": {"es": "{n} cambio(s) gratis", "en": "{n} free restock(s)"},
	"SHOP_PERK_OFFERS": {"es": "{n} % de ofertas", "en": "{n}% offers"},
	"SHOP_PERK_SLOTS": {"es": "{n} huecos", "en": "{n} slots"},
	"SHOP_PERKS_NONE": {"es": "Hazte amigo de Charo: da cambios gratis, ofertas y más huecos.", "en": "Make friends with Karen: she gives free restocks, offers and more slots."},
	# Carta de pijama / Pajama card
	"STATV_MAX_HP": {"es": "+{v} de vida máxima", "en": "+{v} max health"},
	"CHIPV_REGEN": {"es": "+{v} de regeneración", "en": "+{v} regeneration"},
	"CHIPV_LIFESTEAL": {"es": "+{v} % de robo de salud", "en": "+{v}% life steal"},
	"SELECT_MELEE": {"es": "Cuerpo a cuerpo", "en": "Melee"},
	"SELECT_RANGED": {"es": "A distancia", "en": "Ranged"},
	# Magnus, el magnate / Magnus, the magnate
	"GIVER_MAGNUS_NAME": {"es": "Magnus", "en": "Magnus"},
	"GIVER_MAGNUS_ROLE": {"es": "El magnate", "en": "The magnate"},
	"GIVER_MAGNUS_LINE": {"es": "«El dinero no duerme, chaval. Y tú tampoco, por lo que veo.»", "en": "“Money never sleeps, kid. Neither do you, by the looks of it.”"},
	"CHARS_MAGNUS_BIO": {"es": "Un magnate que no se levanta nunca de su escritorio, ni siquiera en los sueños. No regala nada: si le pagas Realidad Fragmentada te sube una estadística, pero solo te la deja si cumples el objetivo que te pone. Si lo cumples, encima te devuelve más dinero.", "en": "A magnate who never gets up from his desk, not even in dreams. He gives nothing away: pay him Fragmented Reality and he raises a stat, but you only keep it if you meet the goal he sets. Meet it, and he pays you back with interest."},
	"ACH_MAGNUS_NAME": {"es": "Junta de accionistas", "en": "Shareholders' meeting"},
	"ACH_MAGNUS_DESC": {"es": "Supera el Acto 3. Magnus empieza a aparecer en el plano astral.", "en": "Clear Act 3. Magnus starts showing up on the astral plane."},
	"TALK_MAGNUS_INTRO": {"es": "«Magnus, encantado. No hago regalos, hago negocios. Tú cumples, yo pago. Tú fallas... yo pago menos.»", "en": "“Magnus, pleased to meet you. I don't do gifts, I do business. You deliver, I pay. You fail... I pay less.”"},
	"TALK_MAGNUS_0": {"es": "«El tiempo es dinero. Y tú me estás haciendo perder las dos cosas.»", "en": "“Time is money. And you're wasting both of mine.”"},
	"TALK_MAGNUS_1": {"es": "«Mi primer negocio fue vender limonada. A los vecinos que ya tenían limones.»", "en": "“My first business was selling lemonade. To neighbours who already had lemons.”"},
	"TALK_MAGNUS_2": {"es": "«Véndeme este boli»", "en": "“Sell me this pen.”"},
	"TALK_MAGNUS_3": {"es": "«Empiezas a ser un tiburón chaval»", "en": "“You're turning into a shark, kid.”"},
	"TALK_MAGNUS_4": {"es": "«Hace años que no me levanto de esta silla. Creo que ya forma parte de mí.»", "en": "“I haven't left this chair in years. I think it's part of me now.”"},
	"TALK_MAGNUS_5": {"es": "«Estoy forrado, pero... No tengo nada, la perdí a ella... Mi vieja silla de oficina.»", "en": "“I'm loaded, but... I have nothing. I lost her... My old office chair.”"},
	"TALK_MAGNUS_THANKS": {"es": "«¿Una propina? ¿A mí? Lo apunto como inversión de futuro.»", "en": "“A tip? For me? I'll file it under long-term investments.”"},
	"INVEST_TITLE": {"es": "Inversión", "en": "Investment"},
	"INVEST_DESC": {"es": "Le pagas {cost} ◆ y ganas estas {n} mejoras ahora mismo. Objetivo del próximo sueño: {goal}. Si lo cumples, te las quedas y te devuelve {payout} ◆. Si no, te las quita y se queda el dinero.", "en": "Pay him {cost} ◆ and gain these {n} boosts right now. Goal for the next dream: {goal}. Meet it and you keep them and get {payout} ◆ back. Miss it and he takes them away and keeps the money."},
	"INVEST_GOAL_KILLS": {"es": "derrota a {n} enemigos", "en": "defeat {n} enemies"},
