	"SHOP_HELLO": {"es": "«¿Qué te pongo, corazón?»", "en": "“What'll it be, sweetheart?”"},
	"SHOP_THANKS_1": {"es": "«¡Huy, qué buena elección, majo! Eso te va a sentar de maravilla.»", "en": "“Ooh, good choice, pet! That'll do you a world of good.”"},
	"SHOP_THANKS_2": {"es": "«Ay, qué niño más apañao. ¿Algo más, rey?»", "en": "“What a sensible little lad. Anything else, love?”"},
	"SHOP_THANKS_3": {"es": "«¡Me has dejado el kiosco pelao! Anda, tira a soñar.»", "en": "“You've cleaned me right out! Go on, off to your dreaming.”"},
