	"ACT4_CLEAR_SUB": {"es": "Kroker se despierta en su cama. Ha atravesado los cuatro sueños, uno dentro de otro, y ha vuelto. Fuera ya es de día.", "en": "Kroker wakes up in his bed. He has gone through all four dreams, one inside the other, and come back. Outside, it's morning."},
